  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.1.0 (Alpha) — first public preview. Concurrency-first core: region layout, thread-safe panes, double-buffered diff rendering, Unicode width, enhanced input, mouse/OSC 8 links, modals and notifications, theming, and a headless backend for tests. Widget toolkit: tables, trees, tabs, forms, menus, fuzzy finder, charts, gauges/progress, color picker, file browser, diff viewer, syntax highlighting, banners, and half-block/sixel/kitty images. Plus reactive binding, animation, and a mouse-capture toggle for native text selection. API and capabilities are subject to change.",
